node_modules/
# T150i (EPIC-014) — the ROOT pattern above matches only the root directory.
# pnpm puts a node_modules in every workspace package, each full of symlinks
# back to sibling packages, and Docker cannot put a symlink-to-outside in a
# build context: `invalid file request agent-adapters/claude/node_modules/@pmi/agent-contract`.
# The build proved what review did not — analysis U1 concluded no edit was
# needed because every LISTED pattern was present, and it was; the gap was a
# pattern nobody had listed.
**/node_modules
**/dist
.git/
dist/
build/
coverage/
*.log
.env
.env.*
Dockerfile*
.dockerignore
specs/
SRS/
adr/
